{"type":"bridge-session","sessionId":"641b53ca-47b3-45aa-9ab6-6db8524d561d","bridgeSessionId":"cse_01L7KbEkDx4V7pgb2xKhFw23","lastSequenceNum":0,"ownerAccountUuid":"a0bda4fd-a29f-4ebe-b5da-0249a6d1079d","ownerOrganizationUuid":"d338ef42-a650-40c7-a017-e1dca5ad4850"}
{"parentUuid":"b8d1ef43-0e1c-4e31-99e1-b1003849ff26","isSidechain":false,"message":{"model":"claude-opus-5-5","id":"msg_011CgEqPwmAYCjDononH17Q9","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"The audit of v1.3's UI against rule 44 is done, and its fixes are merged (#2517, which closes #2516).\n\n**What it fixed in v1.3 code**\n- **Focus return:** three dialogs dropped focus to the page body when they closed. Those are the calendar dialog, \"Promote to calendar\" and \"Promote to channel\". They now return it to the button that opened them, or to a named fallback container if a save removed that button.\n- **Save feedback:** saves for coverage, telemetry and the masking dismiss/restore actions now keep focus nearby and announce the result to screen readers.\n- **Accessible names:** missing or repeated names are fixed on a radio group, a table header and the row actions. The per-period chart, the false-positive tables and the run-detail explanation now have names too.\n- **Keyboard tooltips:** three tooltips that only opened on hover now open on keyboard focus.\n- **Links:** two links that were distinguished only by colour now have underlines.\n\n**Coverage and proof:** the PR adds 7 new keyboard tests and 6 new component accessibility tests. Each regression test fails when its fix is reverted. Three of the component tests pass either way, so they guard against future regressions but don't prove these fixes.\n\n**Passed as shipped:** the per-period editor fields, the GCS and BigQuery forms, the PII-drift fields, the delete-refusal alert, the calendar scan and the theme tokens.\n\n**Left for Week 7, as you asked:** the same audit found problems in older shared components. It recorded each one on #1672 or #1673 rather than fixing them now:\n- dialogs that unmount on close or open with focus on their close button\n- confirm popups that leave focus on the trigger\n- unnamed charts elsewhere in the app\n- repeated button names\n- unnamed tables\n- underlining for inline links across the app\n\n**Still waiting on CI:** #2515 (the OpenAPI contract gate) and #2512 (rules 44–45). I'll merge them in that order once they're green."}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":642,"cache_read_input_tokens":687545,"output_tokens":663,"output_tokens_details":{"thinking_tokens":0},"server_tool_use":{"web_search_requests":0,"web_fetch_requests":0},"service_tier":"standard","cache_creation":{"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":642,"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0},"inference_geo":"global","iterations":[{"input_tokens":2,"output_tokens":663,"cache_read_input_tokens":687545,"cache_creation_input_tokens":642,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":642},"type":"message"}],"speed":"standard","fallback_credit":null},"input_transformations":[],"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"serverClassifierRequest":"65fc612c-5a37-40e4-981b-0c1abe7eb5be","apiBlockIndex":0,"requestId":"req_011CgEqPvuojYCFUdDLyfhFM","requestRef":"9667fa11-8d93-4289-bb26-5b4cf267bee9","requestedModel":"claude-opus-5-5","type":"assistant","uuid":"31e6165f-7442-4fda-ad79-4328d9f5aa2d","timestamp":"2026-10-21T05:32:30.420Z","advisorModel":"claude-fable-5-1","effort":"medium","perTurnEffort":"medium","userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-vscode","cwd":"/Users/arijit/Coding/Python/DataQ","sessionId":"641b53ca-47b3-45aa-9ab6-6db8524d561d","version":"2.1.301","gitBranch":"fix/v13-ui-rule44"}
