{"parentUuid":"a79475d4-3fad-40fa-8bf0-4179822573c9","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"abc88b6b-0c7f-4068-93a6-b3c2a4b46c76","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XEL9kjw97YHLAQKxiVN4fk","type":"tool_result","content":"        <h3>Runs when the pipeline does</h3>\n        <p>Azure Data Factory, Airflow and dbt tell DataQ when a load finishes; the suite runs right after a success and the result is correlated to that pipeline run. Failures ale\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mid-card\">\n        <div class=\"icon-badge\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M816 768h-24V428c0-141.1-104.3-257.7-240-277.1V1\n        <h3>Alerts the right team, once</h3>\n        <p>Microsoft Teams, Slack, email and webhooks, routed by severity and configured per suite. A broken check reports when it breaks and when it gets worse &mdash; not on ever\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"small-grid small-grid-6\">\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v4H3zm0 6h18v4H3zm0 6h18v4H3z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Assets &amp; lineage</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Every table and file DataQ knows about, health rolled up per asset, lineage pulled from dbt, your catalog or the warehouse, incidents anchored where they \n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 2.6 1.4 4.9 3.5 6.1V17h7v-1.\n        <div class=\"title\">Built-in assistant</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Bring your own LLM: suggest checks from a column profile, turn a question into validated SQL, and get a root-cause narrative on a failing run.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H5.2L4 17.2zm2 3v2h12V7zm0 4v2h8v-2z\"/><\n        <div class=\"title\">Open to your AI tools</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">56 MCP tools expose the same actions to Claude, Copilot and Cursor &mdash; every one honest about what it cannot see, none of them touching a credential.<\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.7 8 11 4.6-1.3 8-6 8-11V5zm0\n        <div class=\"title\">Secure by design</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Workspace roles times per-suite grants, three sign-in modes, credentials in Key Vault, Secrets Manager or OpenBao, failing rows redacted, a compliance pac\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h18v4H3zm0 5h18v4H3zm0 5h18v4H3z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Runs where your data lives</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Reference deployments on Azure Container Apps and AWS ECS, a one-command Docker stack for evaluation, no vendor lock-in behind any seam.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v2H4zm0 5h16v2H4zm0 5h10v2H4z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Documented like a product</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Tutorials with screenshots and clips, a generated reference for every check type, endpoint and tool, forty-plus decision records, and pages your assistant\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"50ad7964-3c49-4967-91d0-f95762ff1f34","timestamp":"2026-10-21T05:52:25.767Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"        <h3>Runs when the pipeline does</h3>\n        <p>Azure Data Factory, Airflow and dbt tell DataQ when a load finishes; the suite runs right after a success and the result is correlated to that pipeline run. Failures ale\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"mid-card\">\n        <div class=\"icon-badge\"><svg width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 1024 1024\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M816 768h-24V428c0-141.1-104.3-257.7-240-277.1V1\n        <h3>Alerts the right team, once</h3>\n        <p>Microsoft Teams, Slack, email and webhooks, routed by severity and configured per suite. A broken check reports when it breaks and when it gets worse &mdash; not on ever\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"small-grid small-grid-6\">\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 3h18v4H3zm0 6h18v4H3zm0 6h18v4H3z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Assets &amp; lineage</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Every table and file DataQ knows about, health rolled up per asset, lineage pulled from dbt, your catalog or the warehouse, incidents anchored where they \n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2a7 7 0 0 0-7 7c0 2.6 1.4 4.9 3.5 6.1V17h7v-1.\n        <div class=\"title\">Built-in assistant</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Bring your own LLM: suggest checks from a column profile, turn a question into validated SQL, and get a root-cause narrative on a failing run.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 4h16v12H5.2L4 17.2zm2 3v2h12V7zm0 4v2h8v-2z\"/><\n        <div class=\"title\">Open to your AI tools</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">56 MCP tools expose the same actions to Claude, Copilot and Cursor &mdash; every one honest about what it cannot see, none of them touching a credential.<\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M12 2 4 5v6c0 5 3.4 9.7 8 11 4.6-1.3 8-6 8-11V5zm0\n        <div class=\"title\">Secure by design</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Workspace roles times per-suite grants, three sign-in modes, credentials in Key Vault, Secrets Manager or OpenBao, failing rows redacted, a compliance pac\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M3 5h18v4H3zm0 5h18v4H3zm0 5h18v4H3z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Runs where your data lives</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Reference deployments on Azure Container Apps and AWS ECS, a one-command Docker stack for evaluation, no vendor lock-in behind any seam.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"small-card\">\n        <span class=\"icon-inline\"><svg width=\"22\" height=\"22\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M4 6h16v2H4zm0 5h16v2H4zm0 5h10v2H4z\"/></svg></spa\n        <div class=\"title\">Documented like a product</div>\n        <div class=\"body\">Tutorials with screenshots and clips, a generated reference for every check type, endpoint and tool, forty-plus decision records, and pages your assistant\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</section>","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"3f309f10-866f-4ab0-a542-f6b7ec8e0773","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/arijit/Coding/Python/Da